{"about_the_game":"A picture puzzle game in which you use logic to deduce where to chisel on stone slabs to uncover hidden artifacts. The game includes over 150 puzzles spread across a unique story mode.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game's story mode, you follow 6 characters who are hired to help with an archeological dig at a site uncovered by a local demolitionist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you prefer, you can opt to play individual puzzles from the entire library of included puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, the game includes a puzzle editor for players to make and share puzzles. Advanced users can even create full themes, character avatars, and new story mode campaigns to share with other players.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709250?t=1766098253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709250?t=1766098253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709250/1917c229ad4c880fa9c449cfea6d0132d0500ca7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766098253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709250/1917c229ad4c880fa9c449cfea6d0132d0500ca7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766098253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"A picture puzzle game in which you use logic to deduce where to chisel on stone slabs to uncover hidden artifacts. The game includes over 150 puzzles spread across a unique story mode.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game's story mode, you follow 6 characters who are hired to help with an archeological dig at a site uncovered by a local demolitionist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n